#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Yelp</application> package is not required for a functional"
" <application>GNOME</application> Desktop. Note, however, that without "
"<application>Yelp</application> you will not be able to view the built-in "
"Help provided by core <application>GNOME</application> and many of the "
"support applications."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Yelp</application> não é exigido para uma Área de "
"Trabalho do <application>GNOME</application> funcional. Observe, entretanto,"
" que sem o <application>Yelp</application> você não será capaz de visualizar"
" a Ajuda integrada fornecida pelo <application>GNOME</application> central e"
" por muitos dos aplicativos de suporte."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Yelp"
msgstr "Instalação do Yelp"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, fix a security vulnerability that allows for arbitrary file reads:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija uma vulnerabilidade de segurança que permite leituras "
"arbitrárias de arquivos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../yelp-&yelp-"
"version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../yelp-&yelp-"
"version;-security_fix-1.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Yelp</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Yelp</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, ensure "
"that <filename>/usr/share/applications/mimeinfo.cache</filename> will be "
"updated and therefore the <command>help</command> in gnome applications will"
" work."
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>,"
" certifique-se de que "
"<filename>/usr/share/applications/mimeinfo.cache</filename> será atualizado "
"e, portanto, que o <command>help</command> em aplicativos do GNOME "
"funcionará."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/yelp.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>update-desktop-database</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>update-desktop-database</userinput>"

